WoWFarsi - Persian localization for World of Warcraft
Copyright (c) 2026 the WoWFarsi project. All rights reserved.
Official site: https://pvwvuow.github.io/wow/

1. What is covered
   The Persian translations, translation data, generated data files and the
   addon code in this repository and in the official WoWFarsi addon releases
   (together, the "Work") are original works of the WoWFarsi project.

2. What is NOT covered
   World of Warcraft, its names, spell and talent names, and the original
   English game text belong to Blizzard Entertainment. They are not claimed
   by this project and this license does not affect Blizzard's rights.
   The bundled font Vazirmatn is a separate work under the SIL Open Font
   License 1.1 (see Fonts/OFL.txt); this license does not change its terms.

3. Allowed
   - Installing and using the official WoWFarsi addon for personal use.
   - Quoting short excerpts (a few lines) with a visible credit to WoWFarsi
     and a link to the official site.

4. Not allowed without prior written permission from the project
   - Copying, re-uploading, mirroring or redistributing the Work or the
     addon, in whole or in part, modified or unmodified.
   - Using the Work in another addon, website, app, bot, dataset or
     translation project, or publishing it under another name.
   - Removing or altering copyright notices, credits or author fields.
   - Using the Work to train or fine-tune machine learning models.

5. Enforcement
   Unauthorized copies may be reported to the host (CurseForge, GitHub,
   WoWInterface and others) for removal. The Work is provided "as is",
   without warranty of any kind.

Contact for permission requests: via the official site.
